#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:1 messages/po4a/en.xml:529
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compression"
msgstr "压缩"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Context Compression"
msgstr "上下文压缩"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Runtime context compression: conversations are **fully retained in the database**; only the **four-segment view** sent to the LLM is trimmed.\n"
"> Related: [`sleep.md`](sleep.md), [`memory.md`](memory.md).\n"
msgstr ""
"> 运行时上下文压缩：对话在数据库中**全量保留**；仅裁切发给 LLM 的**四段视图**。\n"
"> 关联：[`sleep.md`](sleep.md)、[`memory.md`](memory.md)。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:10 docs/concepts/sleep.md:13
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Design Principles"
msgstr "设计原则"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Principle           | Description                                                                    |\n"
"| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| No message deletion | History is kept; compression only changes runtime view and conversation meta   |\n"
"| Four segments       | LLM context = system + summary + slim + raw                                    |\n"
"| On-demand trigger   | Compress when usage nears window limits; higher thresholds in tool loops       |\n"
"| Memory-independent  | Compression does not trigger semantic extraction; light sleep cron is separate |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 原则                | 说明                                                                           |\n"
"| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| 不删消息            | 历史保留；压缩仅改变运行时视图与 conversation meta                             |\n"
"| 四段                | LLM 上下文 = system + summary + slim + raw                                     |\n"
"| 按需触发            | 用量接近窗口上限时压缩；工具循环内阈值更高                                     |\n"
"| 与记忆独立          | 压缩不触发语义提取；浅睡 cron 独立运行                                         |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Runtime Four Segments"
msgstr "运行时四段"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"① system  — system prompt (self layer + resident memory + project context)\n"
"② summary — text summary of compressed portion (synthetic; not stored in messages)\n"
"③ slim    — middle segment: trimmed user/assistant messages\n"
"④ raw     — recent segment: full messages including tool calls\n"
msgstr ""
"① system  — system prompt (self layer + resident memory + project context)\n"
"② summary — text summary of compressed portion (synthetic; not stored in messages)\n"
"③ slim    — middle segment: trimmed user/assistant messages\n"
"④ raw     — recent segment: full messages including tool calls\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:29
msgid ""
"Non-compression path: append new messages to raw only; boundaries unchanged."
msgstr "非压缩路径：新消息仅追加到 raw；边界不变。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:31
msgid ""
"Compression path: when usage exceeds thresholds, older messages move into "
"summary/slim; summary text updated asynchronously."
msgstr ""
"压缩路径：用量超过阈值时，较早消息移入 summary/slim；摘要文本异步更新。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:35
msgid ""
"Adjust in `config.yaml` (full example: repo root `config.example.yaml`):"
msgstr ""
"在 `config.yaml` 中调整（完整示例见仓库根目录 `config.example.yaml`）："

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"models:\n"
"  deepseek-v4-flash:\n"
"    context_window: 1000000\n"
"\n"
"compression:\n"
"  enabled: true\n"
"  reserved_tokens: 8192\n"
"  trigger_low: 0.60 # outside tool loop: compress at 60% usage\n"
"  trigger_high: 0.80 # inside tool loop: compress at 80% usage\n"
"  emergency_ratio: 0.92\n"
"  raw_min_messages: 5\n"
"  slim_min_messages: 50\n"
"  summary_max_tokens: 4000\n"
msgstr ""
"models:\n"
"  deepseek-v4-flash:\n"
"    context_window: 1000000\n"
"\n"
"compression:\n"
"  enabled: true\n"
"  reserved_tokens: 8192\n"
"  trigger_low: 0.60 # outside tool loop: compress at 60% usage\n"
"  trigger_high: 0.80 # inside tool loop: compress at 80% usage\n"
"  emergency_ratio: 0.92\n"
"  raw_min_messages: 5\n"
"  slim_min_messages: 50\n"
"  summary_max_tokens: 4000\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Setting             | Default | Description                         |\n"
"| ------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------- |\n"
"| `trigger_low`       | 0.60    | Threshold in normal conversation    |\n"
"| `trigger_high`      | 0.80    | Threshold inside tool loop          |\n"
"| `raw_min_messages`  | 5       | Minimum messages in raw segment     |\n"
"| `slim_min_messages` | 50      | Minimum messages in slim after trim |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 设置                | 默认值  | 说明                                |\n"
"| ------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------- |\n"
"| `trigger_low`       | 0.60    | 普通对话中的阈值                    |\n"
"| `trigger_high`      | 0.80    | 工具循环内的阈值                    |\n"
"| `raw_min_messages`  | 5       | raw 段最少消息数                    |\n"
"| `slim_min_messages` | 50      | 裁剪后 slim 段最少消息数            |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Context window resolution (token mode)"
msgstr "上下文窗口解析（token 模式）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:62
msgid "Priority when estimating compression budget:"
msgstr "估算压缩预算时的优先级："

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:67
msgid "`models.<model>.context_window` in `config.yaml`"
msgstr "`config.yaml` 中的 `models.<model>.context_window`"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:67
msgid "`compression.default_context_window` (applies to all models)"
msgstr "`compression.default_context_window`（适用于所有模型）"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:67
msgid ""
"Provider `/models` catalog `contextWindow` (when Hub has registered lookup)"
msgstr "Provider `/models` 目录中的 `contextWindow`（Hub 已注册 lookup 时）"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:67
msgid ""
"Message-count fallback (`max_rounds` thresholds) when none of the above apply"
msgstr "以上皆无时的消息数回退（`max_rounds` 阈值）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:69
msgid ""
"Per-model config always wins over dynamically fetched catalog values; "
"catalog is read-only and never written back to `config.yaml`."
msgstr ""
"按模型配置始终优先于动态获取的目录值；目录只读，不会写回 `config.yaml`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:71
msgid ""
"Without any context window source, compression falls back to message-count "
"triggers."
msgstr "无任何上下文窗口来源时，压缩回退到按消息数触发。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:73
msgid "Force compression in chat: `/compress` (`--force` ignores hysteresis)."
msgstr "在对话中强制压缩：`/compress`（`--force` 忽略迟滞）。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relationship to Memory Pipeline"
msgstr "与记忆管道的关系"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:76
msgid ""
"Compression and light/deep sleep run **independently**: compression manages "
"the current conversation's LLM window; memory extraction runs nightly from "
"the full conversation archive."
msgstr ""
"压缩与浅睡/深睡**独立运行**：压缩管理当前 conversation 的 LLM 窗口；记忆提取"
"每晚从完整对话存档运行。"
